PURPOSE
H56-H60 separately established:
- conserved bounded active-resource capacity;
- conservative local transport;
- adaptive directed vasculature;
- target-free diffusive demand fields;
- reversible demand-emitter trust.

H61 combines those motifs into one synthetic developmental-metabolism loop.

QUESTION
Can:
DEMAND TRUST
+
EPHEMERAL FIELD ROUTING
+
CONSEQUENCE-GATED TRANSPORT MEMORY
+
TOPOLOGY DAMAGE
+
RARE CRITICAL DEMAND
+
TEMPORARY SINK FAILURE

operate simultaneously without creating:
- runaway sink monopolization;
- false-sink lock-in;
- rare-sink starvation;
- transport-memory hysteresis;
- coupled trust/conductance instability?

BOUNDARY
This is synthetic.

It does not:
- implement the final Yggdrasil organism;
- prove a real target-free uptake signal;
- freeze trust or conductance constants;
- freeze grid topology;
- modify or execute STAB-18-R1.

